## RenderPeek (free AI-readability checker)

RenderPeek is a free tool from We-Amp at https://modpagespeed.com/ai-readability/. Paste a URL and it renders the page in a headless browser the way a modern AI agent does, then grades how much of your content survives without JavaScript, how bloated the markup is, and how well it is described for machines. It shows a side-by-side of the readable tokens an agent recovers from raw HTML (what most crawlers and lighter AI tools get) versus after JavaScript runs — a large shortfall on the raw-HTML side means content is effectively invisible to AI tools that do not render. No signup, one page at a time. Built by a mod_pagespeed maintainer.

